{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80622125d1e91ffcf6b57e487834246402e86e4bd90e1ae622c3f0aa7283cd1a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:886be8a298c7b8f2afdf4b2746dc772f7b46aa0a8096ec79d461aff555826ae0",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n和艺术家老师的碰头会刚结束哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:697d7adedb571c96a30c983a70ebf17f191ec51fc0f63eae7f4722b153b4d996",
      "text": "对方把感觉适合我们的主题要素\n调查得相当细致，让我大吃一惊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:422602cb80bdefbeb9b8e2361714583bc2b2277e324fd1f93d9c3c02e64a59d0",
      "text": "已经把简要的个人资料\n交过去了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc06fc63ead2ee6bb9f9e2711b4e6c43a0d5ebccd959fd74914fbff9ee7929d1",
      "text": "听说对方调查了\n很多资料呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca355bcdc601d4bc477270c2fa21ea11b1f09a6d0e7025568681aca0b7a0cc6",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。难怪能了解得那么深……\n真是一位工作非常热忱的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b0b1630d82f9337ca32fe3ca51a83e2760f64cfa8833c7e5f1f6842105834a2",
      "text": "对方对花卉也做了详细的了解，\n让我很容易提出自己的意见呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3063495a6dcaae4b5a84756410440427ba6fba43d90eadc9acfb81fd7e1080e9",
      "text": "聊得太投机了，\n时间真是一眨眼就过去了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f222f353add2f9171c854c09b661c737c292218c01b861ddb1833bb177b2a8d",
      "text": "当天会用怎样的花来拍摄，\n制作人也敬请期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_c:2_4_011_03_09_c:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5e1d6111cde006b8d853d7578b9501afd181dbb0f17db1a566b402e6e399fd2",
      "text": "为了能拍出对方所期待的画面，\n我会加油的。那就回头发联络给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
